  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {回診|かいしん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to make rounds)\n- {回診|かいしん}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{来|く}る→来る：00254_kuru⟧ (to come on rounds)\n- ⟦{教授|きょうじゅ}→教授：02589_kyouju⟧{回診|かいしん} (professor's rounds - teaching hospital context)\n- ⟦{朝|あさ}→朝：02277_asa⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{回診|かいしん} (morning rounds)\nA standard practice in hospitals where doctors visit each patient's bedside to assess their condition. In teaching hospitals, rounds often include medical students and residents.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{往診|おうしん}→往診：08209_oushin⟧ (house call - visiting patients at home)\n- ⟦{診察|しんさつ}→診察：03259_shinsatsu⟧ (medical examination)\n- ⟦{入院|にゅういん}→入院：02091_nyuuin⟧ (hospitalization)",
